OL,3,AReported assaults on Britain's rail
OL,4,Aservices rise by more than a third
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports of violent incidents and
OL,7,Fharassment on rail services "rose
OL,8,Fsubstantially" last year, figures from
OL,9,Fthe rail regulator show.
OL,11,FReported assaults, including physical
OL,12,Fand verbal, were up 36% in the year to
OL,13,FMarch 2026 compared with the previous
OL,14,Fyear, according to the Office of Rail
OL,15,Fand Road (ORR).
OL,17,FIn total 13,464 assaults against
OL,18,Fpassengers and members of the public
OL,19,Fwere recorded on Britain's mainline
OL,20,Frailway, the highest number recorded
OL,21,Fsince the series began in 2004.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
