OL,3,AReported assaults on Britain's rail
OL,4,Aservices rise by more than a third
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ORR said the figures were
OL,7,F"concerning" and that it was working
OL,8,Fwith the industry to address the
OL,9,Fproblem.
